  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_01",
      "hash64": "0E996DB5BB587890",
      "text": "H-how you doing, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_02",
      "hash64": "0E9970B5BB587DA9",
      "text": "I’ve never been inside the art room before.\\nIt smells like paint in here—but in a good way.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_select_01",
      "hash64": "8AB98C4D1ECCC26F",
      "text": "Something up?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_select_02",
      "hash64": "8AB98D4D1ECCC422",
      "text": "What brings you here?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_03",
      "hash64": "0E996FB5BB587BF6",
      "text": "Um. Well...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_04",
      "hash64": "0E9972B5BB58810F",
      "text": "I’m worried about this rumor that’s going round.\\c\\nPeople are saying Team Star’s planning to raid\\nthe art room or something.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_05",
      "hash64": "0E9971B5BB587F5C",
      "text": "It’s probably just rubbish made up by some kids\\nwho are still scared of Team Star though.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_06",
      "hash64": "0E9974B5BB588475",
      "text": "My friends would never do anything like that.\\nAnd who’d want to raid the art room, anyway?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_01",
      "hash64": "32C34BE2DE9BCEED",
      "text": "Knock knock! We’re comin’ in!!![VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_07",
      "hash64": "0E9973B5BB5882C2",
      "text": "GAH! They actually showed up?![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_01",
      "hash64": "BC38D191D225A331",
      "text": "Wow, this Staraptor is incredible! It looks just like\\nit’s about to attack with Close Combat![VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_02",
      "hash64": "32C348E2DE9BC9D4",
      "text": "Hey. You with the art club or what?[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_student_01",
      "hash64": "FAD62A53CBFFD714",
      "text": "Uh, y-yeah, I am...?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_03",
      "hash64": "32C349E2DE9BCB87",
      "text": "... ... ...[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_08",
      "hash64": "0E9976B5BB5887DB",
      "text": "Don’t tell me that rumor was for real! Are they\\nactually gonna raid the art room?![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_09",
      "hash64": "0E9975B5BB588628",
      "text": "N-no, there’s no way. They wouldn’t. We should\\njust keep watching...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_student_02",
      "hash64": "FAD62D53CBFFDC2D",
      "text": "So, um, did...did you need anything?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_04",
      "hash64": "32C346E2DE9BC66E",
      "text": "Um, yeah. I, uh...I’m here to ask...you know...if...[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_student_03",
      "hash64": "FAD62C53CBFFDA7A",
      "text": "If...?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_05",
      "hash64": "32C347E2DE9BC821",
      "text": "IF YOU GOT ANY LAST WORDS, PUNK![VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_10",
      "hash64": "0E9608B5BB55971A",
      "text": "No WAY! It’s a raid! This is literally a RAID![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_02",
      "hash64": "BC38CE91D2259E18",
      "text": "Oh, knock it off, Mellie![VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_03",
      "hash64": "BC38CF91D2259FCB",
      "text": "Being shy is one thing, but you can’t go around\\nthreatening people to cover it up![VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_06",
      "hash64": "32C344E2DE9BC308",
      "text": "R-right, sorry, Eri. My bad...[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_07",
      "hash64": "32C345E2DE9BC4BB",
      "text": "So, uh...about your club. The art club, I mean.\\nI, um...I was wondering if...I...could join...[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_student_04",
      "hash64": "FAD62753CBFFD1FB",
      "text": "Oh! You wanted to ask about club membership!\\nSheesh, you had me scared there!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_student_05",
      "hash64": "FAD62653CBFFD048",
      "text": "We’re open to any students who want to join.\\nBut, uhhh...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_04",
      "hash64": "BC38D491D225A84A",
      "text": "Yes! Isn’t that great, Mellie?[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_08",
      "hash64": "32C342E2DE9BBFA2",
      "text": "Hang on, Eri. This guy’s still got somethin’ to say.\\c\\nSpit it out, then. I gotta earn my way in or what?[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_student_06",
      "hash64": "FAD62953CBFFD561",
      "text": "Ah, no, it’s just— I was hoping I could ask what\\nprompted you to go for the art club, that’s all.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_09",
      "hash64": "32C343E2DE9BC155",
      "text": "You’re askin’ me why I wanna join? Well, if I\\ngotta explain...[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_10",
      "hash64": "32C6B0E2DE9EB063",
      "text": "One of my pals made this outfit for me.\\nThese sick boots and everythin’.[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_11",
      "hash64": "32C6AFE2DE9EAEB0",
      "text": "I’m big into flame patterns like this, so...I wanna\\ntry and make somethin’ like it myself.[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_12",
      "hash64": "32C6B2E2DE9EB3C9",
      "text": "So. Yeah. PAINTING! That’s what I wanna do![VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_13",
      "hash64": "32C6B1E2DE9EB216",
      "text": "I’m a total newbie at it, but...[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_14",
      "hash64": "32C6B4E2DE9EB72F",
      "text": "I realized somethin’ when I saw that real simple-\\nlookin’ Fletchling painting on the wall there.\\c\\nI don’t hafta be some genius artist. I just wanna\\nmake art that has its own charm, y’know?[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 190,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_student_07",
      "hash64": "FAD62853CBFFD3AE",
      "text": "The Fletchling painting? Um...I did that one.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_15",
      "hash64": "32C6B3E2DE9EB57C",
      "text": "That one’s YOURS?! I thought it was, like, a\\nfinger painting by a kindergartener or something![VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_student_08",
      "hash64": "FAD62353CBFFCB2F",
      "text": "Ha ha! Yeah, I get that all the time.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_mobs_01",
      "hash64": "B969FCA4B7C06176",
      "text": "Our president’s paintings are real lovable ’cause\\nthey’re real simple! Everyone says so!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_16",
      "hash64": "32C6B6E2DE9EBA95",
      "text": "HUH? You’re the art club’s PRESIDENT?[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_mobs_02",
      "hash64": "B969FBA4B7C05FC3",
      "text": "I can already tell we’ll have a lot of fun in the\\nclub together! Could you tell us your name?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_mobs_03",
      "hash64": "B969FAA4B7C05E10",
      "text": "Your boots are awesome! Can I get a closer look?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_hono_17",
      "hash64": "32C6B5E2DE9EB8E2",
      "text": "Th-the name’s Mela... And yeah, good eye!\\nMy boots are the best. A pal of mine who’s a\\r\\nbig arts-and-crafts nerd made them for me.[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_11",
      "hash64": "0E9609B5BB5598CD",
      "text": "So the raid thing was just a misunderstanding...\\c\\nWell, that’s a relief. But wow...I didn’t know that\\nMellie wanted to join the art club.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_05",
      "hash64": "BC38D591D225A9FD",
      "text": "I can’t wait to see what Mellie paints! I bet it’ll be\\nsomething amazing, huh?[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_12",
      "hash64": "0E9606B5BB5593B4",
      "text": "Yeah, I guess...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_13",
      "hash64": "0E9607B5BB559567",
      "text": "GAH! Eri?! How’d you know we were here?![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_06",
      "hash64": "BC38D291D225A4E4",
      "text": "Wait, were you supposed to be hiding?\\c\\nI was wondering what was going on—you were\\njust kinda hanging out in the open over here...[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_07",
      "hash64": "BC38D391D225A697",
      "text": "But you don’t need to worry anyway. Mellie’s\\nbeen too nervous to notice you.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_14",
      "hash64": "0E9604B5BB55904E",
      "text": "Wow. So even Mellie gets the jitters sometimes.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_08",
      "hash64": "BC38C891D22593E6",
      "text": "Trying new things is scary for everyone.\\nThat’s why I came with her for moral support.\\r\\nBut you know? I think she’ll be just fine.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_09",
      "hash64": "BC38C991D2259599",
      "text": "And she’s not the only one doing something new!\\nCarmen and I have started up a wrestling club.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_10",
      "hash64": "BC3C5691D228BB07",
      "text": "Mellie will have a blast here, I’m sure, so I gotta\\nkeep up with her! I’ll enjoy the time I have left at\\r\\nthe academy as much as I can![VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_kakutou_11",
      "hash64": "BC3C5591D228B954",
      "text": "Anyway, it was nice bumping into you both!\\nHasta la vistar! ☆[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_15",
      "hash64": "0E9605B5BB559201",
      "text": "... ... ...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_16",
      "hash64": "0E9602B5BB558CE8",
      "text": "Mellie and Eri really are putting themselves out\\nthere, aren’t they.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_c_17",
      "hash64": "0E9603B5BB558E9B",
      "text": "I...I guess I’ll head off, too. Hasta la vistar... ☆[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
